                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A test facility through which air is forced in a controlled manner so as to study the effects of flow around airfoils, aircraft, motor cars etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "287bd5b1-3fbc-4e79-ad0f-74842e0f8829",
                                                "sense_id": "98778f61-4c33-33cf-96a0-fe3505759f78",
                                                "text": "But unlike many other tunnels that lay idle and decaying, Catesby has now found a new use as an aerodynamic wind tunnel for the motor industry."
